   "corrections": [],
   "notes": "Base salts, phosphate, carbonate buffer, essential copper (5–10 µM) and tungsten (Na2WO4, 0.07 mg/L) come verbatim from the target paper; the 1 ml/L 'trace solution' is cited (ref 9, Demidenko 2016) and its full metal composition was recovered from the same 20Z lineage medium (PMC6570963), adding the previously-missing Ni, Mo, B and W plus EDTA. The nitrogen source is nitrate (KNO3); the 'Ammonium (EX_nh4_e)' entry in current_components is NOT an actual ingredient of this medium. Organism is an aerobic methanotroph grown under O2 limitation (5% O2), so classified aerobic/microaerobic rather th"
